  "asked": "# Build: Style packages — Fable rebuild of style-package@1 Started from the Build manager (\"Start build now\"). Model: fable. Work on branch `fable/style-package-fable` (create it from origin/main), commit there, push it and open a PR. Never merge it. ## What to build Profile: main framework. Fable rebuild of the Opus build of style-package@1 (enterprise-branding s19–s20, branch opus/enterprise-branding). Brett, Oct 27 2026: new type, Opus now + Fable later. Start by reviewing/replacing the Opus version: core/engines/stylepackage.ts, the swap/swapAll member expansion and style.package action in core/runtime.ts, both validators, asset-types.json style-package.members, the 25 starter sets from framework/cli/asset-library.mjs, spec/check-style-packages.mts. Web only; Android twin stays deferred (PORTING.md). ## Steps (≤ 30 min each) 1. [Fable] Review the Opus style-package@1 contract (members registry, slots, tone) against design-package@1 and interface@1; decide what changes; write the decision into framework/spec (STYLE-PACKAGES.md). (~25 min) 2. [Fable] Rebuild the engine + runtime apply paths (swap, swapAll, design-package extras, interfaces, roller): pure fixture spec/fixtures/style-package.json replayed by check-style-packages.mts. (~30 min) 3. [Fable] Re-tune the 25 starter control sets against DESIGN-LANGUAGE.md (distinct, coherent with the colour/style themes they pair with) and regenerate fixtures. (~25 min) 4. [Fable] Differences report _claude/memory/docs/rebuilds/style-package-fable.md + LOG.md line; re-bake the five web apps; checks green. (~15 min) ## Do not touch (being built by other sessions right now) - apps/amberx-droid Running now: “Fix: Console public URL set” (Console launch, fix/syscheck-routine-env-public-url); “Fix: Hub /projects folder is mounted” (Console launch, fix/syscheck-routine-env-axhub-projects-dir); “AmberX at amberx.amberxai.com + in-app hub sign-in” (Cloud, claude/project-thread-kxgzso). Expected to touch: see the item. ## Rules - Follow CLAUDE.md and _claude/rules/RULES.md + _claude/shared/rules/RULES.md (plugin rules, theme tokens only, no secrets, small steps, Android on hold). ## Report to the Build manager (axHub) as you go The console already opened your Codebase changes entry (the hook adopts it through AXF_ADOPT_CHANGE and prints its id; `last` points at it). Record estimates first, then steps, then the result: node apps/console-web/plugins/codebase-changes/changes.mjs update last --ref pending:style-package-fable --model fable --estimate-min 95 --branch fable/style-package-fable node apps/console-web/plugins/codebase-changes/changes.mjs step last \"<step>\" --state running (then done) node apps/console-web/plugins/codebase-changes/changes.mjs result last --state done --summary \"<what changed>\" --branch fable/style-package-fable --commit <sha> --link pr=<PR url> ## When done, check nothing broke (run each; report failures in the result) - project manifests: `node framework/cli/project.mjs validate --all`",
